# BBQ Lentils

Instapot BBQ Lentils

## Ingredients
- 1 bag dry lentils (1 pound)
- 1 onion, chopped
- celery, chopped
- BBQ sauce
- Veggie broth, 4 cups
- 1/2 tsp salt, optional
- 1/2 tsp black pepper, optional
- 3 jalapeno peppers, chopped, optional

## Instructions
1. Chop veggies
2. Put into Instapot
3. Add a little water
4. Saute for a few minutes
5. Add dry lentils, mix
6. Add half to full cup of BBQ sauce
7. Add 4 cups veggie broth
8. Seal Instapot
9. Set to PC, 20-24 minutes
10. After done with PC, let sit on pressure
11. Wait 5 minutes
12. Release pressure

Optionally add salt, black pepper, jalapeno peppers

